# Khorinis market at noon on the move: the hero walks to and fro and the camera follows (the route of the first clip
# of upscale-clips.bench). The other places hold the camera still; what costs only in motion (the temporal upscale's
# enlarged frame) shows here.
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
cadence normal
overlay off
ui off
view full
cam lift off
goto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04
watch player
walkmode walk
cam look 120
cam follow 380 170 160
# Ten real seconds after the teleport for loading and native simulation.
wait 10000
walkto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_PATH_09
wait 500
perf sample perf-market-walk/view-1
wait 8000
perf stop
walkto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04
wait 500
perf sample perf-market-walk/view-2
wait 8000
perf stop
walkto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_PATH_09
wait 500
perf sample perf-market-walk/view-3
wait 8000
perf stop
walkto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04
wait 500
perf sample perf-market-walk/view-4
wait 8000
perf stop
